.TH "LINTO-INSTALL" 1

.SH "Installation and setup"
.PP
Add this checkout's \fBbin/\fP directory to your \fBPATH\fP, or run the setup helper to
configure your current shell:
.RS
.PP
.nf
linto\-linto\-setup
.fi
.RE
.PP
The setup helper is safe to run more than once\. It configures supported shell
startup files for Bash, Zsh, and other detected shells\. To install the \fBlinto(1)\fP
man page as well:
.RS
.PP
.nf
linto\-linto\-setup \-\-man
.fi
.RE
.PP
If \fBman linto\fP is not found, ensure your user man directory is included in
\fBMANPATH\fP\. Run \fBlinto\-linto\-addman \-\-help\fP for details\.
.PP
You can also configure \fBPATH\fP manually:
.RS
.PP
.nf
export PATH="/path/to/linto/bin:$PATH"
.fi
.RE
.PP
The path \fB/path/to/linto\fP should be replaced with this checkout's actual
location\. See Shell completion for optional tab completion\.
